<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alumax upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alumax upgraded to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities has raised its rating of Alumax Inc to buy from hold, a Prudential source said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Alumax shares closed at 31-7/8 on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
